Structure HomologyTheory(K: Type, field: FieldStructure(K)):
  Universe: 1
  Let coefficients: CoefficientModule(K,field)
  Let degree: Natural
  Constructor: homology theory
  Render latex: \mathcal{{H}}
  Describe: a choice of coefficients and homology degree over ${K}$

Notation homology module(field,H,X):
  Let K: Type
  Let field: FieldStructure(K)
  Let H: HomologyTheory(K,field)
  Let X: TopologicalSpace
